B) \unsure{Anharmonic} \inserted{elliptic} curves of hexagonal type.

The category of these curves \unsure{equivalent} \unsure{:|to} that of oriented hexagons, that is, of torsors $S$ under
\[
\begin{aligned}
\mathbb Z/6\mathbb Z&\simeq\mu_6(\mathbb C)\simeq
\text{group of \inserted{\unsure{algebraic}} units of }Q(\underbrace{\sqrt[3]{1}}_{\zeta})\\
&\simeq\text{group of units of}\\
&\qquad \deleted{\mathbb Z[\zeta]\unsure{=}\mathbb Z[T]/}\\
&\qquad \mathbb Z[\zeta]=\mathbb Z[T]/(1+T+T^2)\\
&\qquad (\zeta=\exp 2i\pi/3)
\end{aligned}
\]

